\">{item.d}</p>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          ))}\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"mt-5 pt-5 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-end\">\n                        <button onClick={() => setOpenModal('veille1')} className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                          Consulter le dossier →\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </GlareHover>\n                </AnimatedContent>\n                {/* Veille 2 — bannière */}\n                <AnimatedContent distance={40} delay={0.15} duration={0.6} className=\"w-full\">\n                  <GlareHover\n                    width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"\n                    background=\"linear-gradient(145deg, #09090b 0%, #18181b 100%)\"\n                    borderColor=\"#6366f1\" glareColor=\"#6366f1\" glareOpacity={0.08} glareSize={350}\n                  >\n                    <div className=\"p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4\">\n                      <Search size={24} className=\"text-indigo-500 flex-shrink-0\" loop={true} loopDelay={2000} />\n                      <div className=\"flex-1\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\">\n                          <span className=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-indigo-400/90\">Veille 2</span>\n                          <span className=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/40 text-indigo-300/70 bg-indigo-500/10\">En préparation</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm font-medium\">Cybersécurité · Cloud Computing · DevOps</p>\n                      </div>\n                      <button onClick={() => setOpenModal('veille2')} className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-500 hover:text-indigo-400 transition flex-shrink-0\">\n                        En savoir plus →\n                      </button>\n                    </div>\n                  </GlareHover>\n                </AnimatedContent>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n\n            {/* ─── PROJETS E5 ─── */}\n            <section id=\"e5\" className=\"py-16 scroll-mt-14\">\n              <AnimatedContent distance={30} duration={0.6}>\n                <SectionLabel num=\"06\">Projets E5 — Épreuve Pratique</SectionLabel>\n                <p className=\"text-gray-400 text-sm -mt-6 mb-10 max-w-2xl\">\n                  Projets réalisés dans le cadre de l&apos;épreuve E5 du BTS SIO.\n                </p>\n              </AnimatedContent>\n              {/* Cartes horizontales empilées */}\n              <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                {([\n                  {\n                    icon: <Monitor size={32} className=\"text-indigo-400\" loop={true} loopDelay={2000} />,\n                    num: '01',\n                    title: 'Gestion de Parc Informatique',\n                    desc: \"Application web complète pour la gestion d'un parc informatique d'entreprise.\",\n                    points: [\"Inventaire & tickets d'intervention\", 'Maintenance préventive planifiée', 'Tableau de bord & export PDF'],\n                    badges: ['PHP', 'MySQL', 'JavaScript', 'Bootstrap'],\n                    accent: '#818cf8',\n                    modal: 'e5projet1' as ModalKey,\n                  },\n                  {\n                    icon: <Lock size={32} className=\"text-indigo-400\" loop={true} loopDelay={2000} />,\n                    num: '02',\n                    title: 'Infrastructure Réseau Sécurisée',\n                    desc: \"Déploiement d'une infrastructure réseau complète pour une PME.\",\n                    points: ['VLANs Administration / Production / Invités', 'pfSense + OpenVPN + DHCP/DNS', 'Supervision Nagios + documentation'],\n                    badges: ['pfSense', 'VLANs', 'OpenVPN', 'Nagios'],\n                    accent: '#6366f1',\n                    modal: 'e5projet2' as ModalKey,\n                  },\n                ] as { icon: React.ReactNode; num: string; title: string; desc: string; points: string[]; badges: string[]; accent: string; modal: ModalKey }[]).map((item, i) => (\n                  <AnimatedContent key={i} distance={40} delay={i * 0.15} duration={0.6} className=\"w-full\">\n                    <GlareHover\n                      width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"\n                      background=\"linear-gradient(145deg, #09090b 0%, #18181b 100%)\"\n                      borderColor={item.accent} glareColor={item.accent} glareOpacity={0.14} glareSize={400}\n                    >\n                      <div className=\"p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 sm:items-start\">\n                        {/* left col */}\n                        <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4 flex-shrink-0\">\n                          {item.icon}\n                          <div>\n                            <span className=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase opacity-70\" style={{ color: item.accent }}>Projet E5 — {item.num}</span>\n                            <h3 className=\"text-base font-bold text-white mt-0.5 leading-snug max-w-[180px]\">{item.title}</h3>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        {/* center */}\n                        <div className=\"flex-1 space-y-1.5\">\n                          <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3 leading-relaxed\">{item.desc}</p>\n                          {item.points.map((p, j) => (\n                            <div key={j} className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-200\">\n                              <span className=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style={{ backgroundColor: item.accent }} />\n                              {p}\n                            </div>\n                          ))}\n                        </div>\n                        {/* right col */}\n                        <div className=\"flex flex-row sm:flex-col items-start sm:items-end gap-2 flex-shrink-0\">\n                          <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:justify-end mb-1\">\n                            {item.badges.map((b, j) => <Badge key={j} accent={item.accent}>{b}</Badge>)}\n                          </div>\n                          <button\n                            onClick={() => setOpenModal(item.modal)}\n                            className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-white transition mt-auto\"\n                            style={{ color: item.accent }}\n                          >\n                            Détails →\n                          </button>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </GlareHover>\n                  </AnimatedContent>\n                ))}\n              </div>\n            </section>\n\n            {/* ─── TABLEAU DE COMPÉTENCES ─── */}\n            <section id=\"competences\" className=\"py-16 scroll-mt-14\">\n              <AnimatedContent distance={30} duration={0.6}>\n                <SectionLabel num=\"07\">Tableau de Synthèse des Compétences</SectionLabel>\n                <div\n                  className=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden -mx-4 md:-mx-8 border border-white/10\"\n                  style={{ background: 'rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.40)', backdropFilter: 'blur(12px)' }}\n                >\n                  <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                    <table\n                      style={{\n                        width: '100%',\n                        borderCollapse: 'collapse',\n                        fontSize: '0.88rem',\n                        tableLayout: 'fixed',\n                      }}\n                    >\n                      <thead style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.03)' }}>\n                        <tr>\n                          <th\n                            style={{\n                              width: '22%',\n                              padding: '12px 14px',\n                              textAlign: 'left',\n                              color: '#cbd5e1',\n                              fontWeight: 600,\n                              border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',\n                              whiteSpace: 'normal',\n                              wordWrap: 'break-word',\n                              verticalAlign: 'middle',\n                              lineHeight: 1.3,\n                            }}\n                          >\n                            Réalisations professionnelles\n                          </th>\n                          <th\n                            style={{\n                              width: '10%',\n                              padding: '12px 8px',\n                              textAlign: 'center',\n                              color: '#cbd5e1',\n                              fontWeight: 600,\n                              border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',\n                              whiteSpace: 'normal',\n                              wordWrap: 'break-word',\n                              verticalAlign: 'middle',\n                              lineHeight: 1.3,\n                            }}\n                          >\n                            Période\n                          </th>\n                          {COMPETENCE_HEADERS.map((h, i) => (\n                            <th\n                              key={i}\n                              style={{\n                                width: `${68 / 6}%`,\n                                padding: '12px 8px',\n                                textAlign: 'center',\n                                color: '#cbd5e1',\n                                fontWeight: 600,\n                                border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',\n                                whiteSpace: 'normal',\n                                wordWrap: 'break-word',\n                                verticalAlign: 'middle',\n                                lineHeight: 1.3,\n                              }}\n                            >\n                              {h}\n                            </th>\n                          ))}\n                        </tr>\n                      </thead>\n                      <tbody>\n                        {COMPETENCE_ROWS.map((row, i) => (\n                          <tr\n                            key={i}\n                            style={{ transition: 'background 0.2s' }}\n                            onMouseEnter={(e) => (e.currentTarget.style.background = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.03)')}\n                            onMouseLeave={(e) => (e.currentTarget.style.background = 'transparent')}\n                          >\n                            <td\n                              style={{\n                                padding: '10px 14px',\n                                border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',\n                                color: '#e5e7eb',\n                                textAlign: 'left',\n                                verticalAlign: 'middle',\n                                lineHeight: 1.4,\n                              }}\n                            >\n                              {row.name}\n                            </td>\n                            <td\n                              style={{\n                                padding: '10px 8px',\n                                border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',\n                                color: '#94a3b8',\n                                textAlign: 'center',\n                                verticalAlign: 'middle',\n                                fontSize: '0.82rem',\n                                lineHeight: 1.5,\n                              }}\n                            >\n                              {row.period.map((p, j) => (\n                                <span key={j}>\n                                  {p}\n                                  {j < row.period.length - 1 && <br />}\n                                </span>\n                              ))}\n                            </td>\n                            {row.comps.map((c, j) => (\n                              <td\n                                key={j}\n                                style={{\n                                  padding: '10px 8px',\n                                  border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',\n                                  textAlign: 'center',\n                                  verticalAlign: 'middle',\n                                  color: c ? '#818cf8' : 'transparent',\n                                  fontWeight: c ? 700 : 400,\n                                  fontSize: '1rem',\n                                  transition: 'background 0.2s',\n                                }}\n                              >\n                                {c ? 'X' : ''}\n                              </td>\n                            ))}\n                          </tr>\n                        ))}\n                      </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"px-4 py-3 border-t border-white/10 text-xs text-gray-500 italic\">\n                    <strong className=\"text-gray-400 not-italic\">Légende :</strong>{' '}\n                    <span className=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold not-italic\">X</span> = Compétence acquise\n                    {' | '}\n                    <span className=\"text-yellow-400 font-bold not-italic\">~</span> = Compétence en cours d&apos;acquisition\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </AnimatedContent>\n            </section>\n\n            {/* ─── CONTACT ─── */}\n            <section id=\"contact\" className=\"py-16 scroll-mt-14\">\n              <AnimatedContent distance={30} duration={0.6}>\n                <SectionLabel num=\"08\">Contact</SectionLabel>\n              </AnimatedContent>\n              <div className=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12\">\n                  <AnimatedContent distance={40} delay={0} duration={0.6}>\n                    <div className=\"bg-zinc-950/80 border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-6 text-center hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl\">\n                      <div className=\"flex justify-center mb-4\">\n                        <Image src=\"/images/icons/email.svg\" alt=\"Email\" width={56} height={56} />\n                      </div>\n                      <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Email</h3>\n                      <a href=\"#\" onClick={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); window.location.href = 'mailto:' + ['contact', 'netcy.fr'].join('@'); }} className=\"text-indigo-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                        contact@netcy.fr\n                      </a>\n                    </div>\n                  </AnimatedContent>\n                  <AnimatedContent distance={40} delay={0.15} duration={0.6}>\n                    <div className=\"bg-zinc-950/80 border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-6 text-center hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl\">\n                      <div className=\"flex justify-center mb-4\">\n                        <Image src=\"/images/icons/smartphone.svg\" alt=\"Instagram\" width={34} height={34} />\n                      </div>\n                      <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Instagram</h3>\n                      <a className=\"text-indigo-400 hover:text-white transition\">@netcy.dev</a>\n                    </div>\n                  </AnimatedContent>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"w-full\">\n                  <form onSubmit={async (e) => {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    const form = e.target as HTMLFormElement;\n                    const formData = new FormData(form);\n                    const nom = formData.get('nom') as string;\n                    const email = formData.get('email') as string;\n                    const entreprise = formData.get('entreprise') as string;\n                    const typeProjet = formData.get('typeProjet') as string;\n                    const budget = formData.get('budget') as string;\n                    const delai = formData.get('delai') as string;\n                    const details = formData.get('details') as string;\n                    const privacy = formData.get('privacy') as string;\n                    if (!privacy) {\n                      alert('Veuillez accepter les conditions d\\'utilisation');\n                      return;\n                    }\n                    const submitButton = form.querySelector('button[type=\"submit\"]') as HTMLButtonElement;\n                    if (submitButton) {\n                      submitButton.disabled = true;\n                      submitButton.textContent = 'Envoi en cours...';\n                    }\n                    try {\n                      const response = await fetch('/api/send-email', {\n                        method: 'POST',\n                        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n                        body: JSON.stringify({ nom, email, entreprise, typeProjet, budget, delai, details }),\n                      });\n                      const result = await response.json();\n                      if (result.success) {\n                        router.push('/contact-success');\n                      } else {\n                        alert('Une erreur est survenue. Veuillez réessayer.');\n                        if (submitButton) { submitButton.disabled = false; submitButton.textContent = 'Envoyer le Message'; }\n                      }\n                    } catch {\n                      alert('Une erreur est survenue. Veuillez réessayer.');\n                      if (submitButton) { submitButton.disabled = false; submitButton.textContent = 'Envoyer le Message'; }\n                    }\n                  }} className=\"bg-zinc-950/80 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md w-full\">\n                    <div className=\"mb-8\">\n                      <h2 className=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-200 to-slate-400 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        <Image src=\"/images/icons/clipboard.svg\" alt=\"Formulaire contact\" width={40} height={40} />\n                        Formulaire de Contact\n                      </h2>\n                      <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Remplissez ce formulaire et je vous recontacterai dans les 24h</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6\">\n                      <div>\n                        <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Nom Complet *</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" name=\"nom\" required className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition\" placeholder=\"Votre nom\" />\n                      </div>\n                      <div>\n                        <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Email *</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition\" placeholder=\"votre@email.com\" />\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6\">\n                      <div>\n                        <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Entreprise</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" name=\"entreprise\" className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition\" placeholder=\"Votre entreprise\" />\n                      </div>\n                      <div>\n                        <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Type de Projet *</label>\n                        <div className=\"select-wrapper\">\n                          <select name=\"typeProjet\" required className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition appearance-none cursor-pointer\">\n                            <option value=\"\">Sélectionnez un type...</option>\n                            <option value=\"web\">Site Web</option>\n                            <option value=\"ecommerce\">E-Commerce</option>\n                            <option value=\"consultation\">Consultation</option>\n                            <option value=\"other\">Autre</option>\n                          </select>\n                          <svg className=\"select-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\" strokeWidth=\"2\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\"></polyline>\n                          </svg>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"mb-6\">\n                      <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Budget Estimé</label>\n                      <div className=\"select-wrapper\">\n                        <select name=\"budget\" className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition appearance-none cursor-pointer\">\n                          <option value=\"\">Sélectionnez un budget...</option>\n                          <option value=\"1000\">Moins de 1 000€</option>\n                          <option value=\"5000\">1 000€ - 5 000€</option>\n                          <option value=\"10000\">5 000€ - 10 000€</option>\n                          <option value=\"25000\">10 000€ - 25 000€</option>\n                          <option value=\"50000\">Plus de 25 000€</option>\n                        </select>\n                        <svg className=\"select-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                          <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\" strokeWidth=\"2\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\"></polyline>\n                        </svg>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"mb-6\">\n                      <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Délai Souhaité</label>\n                      <div className=\"select-wrapper\">\n                        <select name=\"delai\" className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition appearance-none cursor-pointer\">\n                          <option value=\"\">Sélectionnez un délai...</option>\n                          <option value=\"urgent\">Urgent (moins d&apos;un mois)</option>\n                          <option value=\"soon\">Rapide (1-3 mois)</option>\n                          <option value=\"flexible\">Flexible (3+ mois)</option>\n                        </select>\n                        <svg className=\"select-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                          <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\" strokeWidth=\"2\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\"></polyline>\n                        </svg>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"mb-6\">\n                      <label className=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-300\">Détails du Projet *</label>\n                      <textarea name=\"details\" rows={5} required className=\"w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition resize-none\" placeholder=\"Décrivez votre projet, vos objectifs, et ce que vous attendez de moi...\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center mb-6 group\">\n                      <Checkbox\n                        name=\"privacy\"\n                        id=\"privacy-portfolio\"\n                        required\n                        checked={privacyAccepted}\n                        onCheckedChange={setPrivacyAccepted}\n                        className=\"border-white/10 bg-black/40 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500/50 [&[data-checked]]:bg-white [&[data-checked]]:text-zinc-950 [&[data-checked]]:border-white hover:border-white/30\"\n                      />\n                      <label htmlFor=\"privacy-portfolio\" className=\"ml-3 text-sm text-gray-400 cursor-pointer group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors leading-5\">\n                        J&apos;accepte les{' '}\n                        <a href=\"/cgu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" className=\"text-indigo-400 hover:text-white underline\">conditions d&apos;utilisation</a>\n                        {' '}et la{' '}\n                        <a href=\"/politique-confidentialite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" className=\"text-indigo-400 hover:text-white underline\">politique de confidentialité</a>\n                        {' '}*\n                      </label>\n                    </div>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full bg-white text-zinc-950 hover:bg-slate-200 font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition shadow-lg shadow-white/5 cursor-pointer\">\n                      Envoyer le Message\n                    </button>\n                  </form>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Footer */}\n          <footer className=\"py-8 px-4 text-center border-t border-white/10 mt-8\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">© 2025 Jung Jean-Marie — Portfolio BTS SIO</p>\n            <p className=\"text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1\">Tous droits réservés</p>\n          </footer>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* ══════════════ MODALS ══════════════ */}\n\n      <Modal isOpen={openModal === 'stage'} onClose={() => setOpenModal(null)} title=\"Stage 1er Année — InfoBoost\">\n        <p className=\"text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono mb-6 tracking-wider\">04/2025 → 07/2025</p>\n        <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n          <ModalSection title=\"Description du stage\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Stage chez Infoboost en tant que technicien de reconditionnement, avec participation à un module de cybersécurité destiné aux PME. Cette expérience m&apos;a permis de découvrir les aspects pratiques de la maintenance informatique et de la sensibilisation à la sécurité.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Compétences développées\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {['Reconditionnement de matériel informatique', 'Diagnostic et réparation de composants', 'Sensibilisation cybersécurité pour PME', 'Gestion de parc informatique'].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Technologies\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n              {['Hardware', 'Reconditionnement', 'Cybersécurité', 'PME'].map((b, i) => <Badge key={i}>{b}</Badge>)}\n            </div>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <div className=\"pt-1\">\n            <a href=\"/Stages/Rapport_Stage_Jean-Marie_Jung_Infoboost.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-zinc-950 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-lg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 text-sm transition\">\n              <FileText size={16} loop={true} loopDelay={2500} /> Rapport de stage\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </Modal>\n\n      <Modal isOpen={openModal === 'projet'} onClose={() => setOpenModal(null)} title=\"Projet — Hotel Neptune\">\n        <p className=\"text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono mb-6 tracking-wider\">Projet académique BTS SIO</p>\n        <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n          <ModalSection title=\"Contexte du projet\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Développement d&apos;une application web complète pour la gestion d&apos;un hôtel fictif &quot;Neptune&quot;. Ce projet couvre l&apos;ensemble du cycle de développement, de la conception à la mise en production.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Technologies\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n              {['HTML/CSS', 'JavaScript', 'PHP', 'MySQL', 'Bootstrap'].map((b, i) => <Badge key={i} accent=\"#818cf8\">{b}</Badge>)}\n            </div>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Fonctionnalités\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {[\"Système de réservation en ligne\", \"Gestion des chambres et disponibilités\", \"Interface d'administration\", \"Système de paiement sécurisé\", \"Gestion des clients et historique\"].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <div className=\"pt-1\">\n            <a href=\"https://github.com/jean-marie-jung/hotel-neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-zinc-950 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-lg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 text-sm transition\">\n              Voir sur GitHub\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </Modal>\n\n      <Modal isOpen={openModal === 'veille1'} onClose={() => setOpenModal(null)} title=\"Veille — Machine Learning & LLM\">\n        <p className=\"text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono mb-6 tracking-wider\">2024-2025</p>\n        <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n          <ModalSection title=\"Sujets de veille\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-3\">\n              {[\n                { t: 'Machine Learning', d: \"Évolution des algorithmes et nouvelles approches supervisées/non supervisées\" },\n                { t: 'Modèles de langage IA', d: \"Progrès des LLM (Large Language Models) et cas d'usage émergents\" },\n                { t: \"Éthique de l'IA\", d: \"Enjeux sociétaux et réglementaires autour de l'intelligence artificielle\" },\n              ].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold\">{item.t} : </span>{item.d}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Sources et méthodes\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Veille réalisée via sources spécialisées, articles de recherche, conférences et retours d&apos;expérience d&apos;entreprises du secteur.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <div className=\"pt-1\">\n            <a href=\"/Veille/Dossier_Veille_IA_ML_Jung_Jean_Marie.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n              className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-zinc-950 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-lg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 text-sm transition\">\n              <FileText size={16} loop={true} loopDelay={2500} /> Consulter le dossier de veille\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </Modal>\n\n      <Modal isOpen={openModal === 'veille2'} onClose={() => setOpenModal(null)} title=\"Veille 2 — À venir\">\n        <p className=\"text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono mb-6 tracking-wider\">En préparation</p>\n        <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n          <ModalSection title=\"Prochaine veille technologique\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Une nouvelle veille est en cours de préparation et sera disponible prochainement.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Sujets envisagés\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {['Cybersécurité et nouvelles menaces', 'Cloud Computing et architectures distribuées', 'DevOps et automatisation', \"Technologies émergentes en infrastructure\"].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Calendrier prévisionnel\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Finalisée d&apos;ici la fin du semestre avec les dernières tendances du secteur SISR.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n        </div>\n      </Modal>\n\n      <Modal isOpen={openModal === 'e5projet1'} onClose={() => setOpenModal(null)} title=\"Projet E5 — Gestion de Parc Informatique\">\n        <p className=\"text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono mb-6 tracking-wider\">Projet BTS SIO — 2025</p>\n        <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n          <ModalSection title=\"Description\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Application web complète pour la gestion d&apos;un parc informatique d&apos;entreprise : inventaire du matériel, interventions techniques et maintenance préventive.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Technologies\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n              {['HTML/CSS', 'JavaScript', 'PHP', 'MySQL', 'Bootstrap'].map((b, i) => <Badge key={i}>{b}</Badge>)}\n            </div>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Fonctionnalités\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {[\"Inventaire complet du matériel\", \"Gestion des tickets d'intervention\", \"Maintenance préventive planifiée\", \"Tableau de bord statistiques\", \"Notifications automatiques\", \"Export de rapports PDF\"].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Compétences mobilisées\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {[\"Conception BDD relationnelle\", \"Backend PHP\", \"Interface responsive\", \"Sécurisation des accès\", \"Tests unitaires\"].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n        </div>\n      </Modal>\n\n      <Modal isOpen={openModal === 'e5projet2'} onClose={() => setOpenModal(null)} title=\"Projet E5 — Infrastructure Réseau Sécurisée\">\n        <p className=\"text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono mb-6 tracking-wider\">Projet BTS SIO — 2025</p>\n        <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n          <ModalSection title=\"Description\">\n            <p className=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n              Conception et déploiement d&apos;une infrastructure réseau sécurisée pour une PME : VLANs, pare-feu, VPN et supervision réseau.\n            </p>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Technologies\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n              {['pfSense', 'Cisco Packet Tracer', 'VLANs', 'OpenVPN', 'Nagios'].map((b, i) => <Badge key={i} accent=\"#818cf8\">{b}</Badge>)}\n            </div>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Réalisations techniques\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {[\n                \"VLANs : Administration, Production, Invités\",\n                \"Pare-feu pfSense avec règles de filtrage\",\n                \"VPN OpenVPN pour accès distant sécurisé\",\n                \"Serveur DHCP et DNS\",\n                \"Supervision avec Nagios\",\n                \"Documentation complète de l'infrastructure\",\n              ].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n          <ModalSection title=\"Compétences mobilisées\">\n            <ul className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {[\"Architecture réseau TCP/IP\", \"Sécurisation des infrastructures\", \"Configuration pare-feu et VPN\", \"Monitoring réseau\", \"Documentation technique\"].map((item, i) => (\n                <li key={i} className=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n                  <span className=\"text-indigo-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">›</span>{item}\n                </li>\n              ))}\n            </ul>\n          </ModalSection>\n        </div>\n      </Modal>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n","usedDeprecatedRules":[]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jung Jean-Marie\\netcy_test\\src\\app\\qr\\page.tsx","messages":[{"ruleId":"@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars","severity":1,"message":"'dynamic' is defined but never used.","line":4,"column":8,"nodeType":null,"messageId":"unusedVar","endLine":4,"endColumn":15},{"ruleId":"react-hooks/set-state-in-effect","severity":2,"message":"Error: Calling setState synchronously within an effect can trigger cascading renders\n\nEffects are intended to synchronize state between React and external systems such as manually updating the DOM, state management libraries, or other platform APIs. In general, the body of an effect should do one or both of the following:\n* Update external systems with the latest state from React.\n* Subscribe for updates from some external system, calling setState in a callback function when external state changes.\n\nCalling setState synchronously within an effect body causes cascading renders that can hurt performance, and is not recommended. (https://react.dev/learn/you-might-not-need-an-effect).\n\nC:\\Users\\Jung Jean-Marie\\netcy_test\\src\\app\\qr\\page.tsx:27:5\n  25 |\n  26 |   useEffect(() => {\n> 27 |     setIsMobile(isMobileDevice());\n     |     ^^^^^^^^^^^ Avoid calling setState() directly within an effect\n  28 |   }, []);\n  29 |\n  30 |   useEffect(() => {","line":27,"column":5,"nodeType":null,"endLine":27,"endColumn":16}],"suppressedMessages":[],"errorCount":1,"fatalErrorCount":0,"warningCount":1,"fixableErrorCount":0,"fixableWarningCount":0,"source":"'use client';\n\nimport { useState, useEffect } from 'react';\nimport dynamic from 'next/dynamic';\nimport LiquidEther from \"@/components/LiquidEther\";\nimport TextType from \"@/components/TextType\";\nimport GradientText from \"@/components/GradientText\";\nimport MetallicLogo from \"@/components/MetallicLogo\";\nimport StarBorder from \"@/components/StarBorder\";\nimport LoadingScreen from \"@/components/LoadingScreen\";\nimport Link from 'next/link';\n\n\n\nconst isMobileDevice = () => {\n  if (typeof window === 'undefined') return false;\n  const ua = /Android|webOS|iPhone|iPad|iPod|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Opera Mini/i.test(navigator.userAgent);\n  const isSmallScreen = window.innerWidth <= 1024;\n  return ua || isSmallScreen;\n};\n\nexport default function QRLandingPage() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [isMobile, setIsMobile] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    setIsMobile(isMobileDevice());\n  }, []);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const criticalImages = [\n      '/images/logo_tab.png'\n    ];\n\n    const preloadImages = () => {\n      const promises = criticalImages.map(src => {\n        return new Promise((resolve) => {\n          const img = new window.Image();\n          img.src = src;\n          img.onload = resolve;\n          img.onerror = resolve;\n        });\n      });\n\n      return Promise.all(promises);\n    };\n\n    const handleLoad = async () => {\n      await preloadImages();\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        setIsLoading(false);\n      }, 300);\n    };\n\n    if (document.readyState === 'complete') {\n      handleLoad();\n    } else {\n      window.addEventListener('load', handleLoad);\n      return () => window.removeEventListener('load', handleLoad);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <LoadingScreen isLoading={isLoading} />\n      <div className=\"w-full text-white overflow-x-hidden relative\">\n      <div className=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0\">\n        <LiquidEther \n          colors={['#6F3FFF', '#7A8FFF', '#8FA5FF', '#4A2FFF']}\n          mouseForce={isMobile ? 80 : 20}\n          cursorSize={isMobile ? 250 : 100}\n          autoDemo={!isMobile}\n          autoSpeed={0.5}\n          autoIntensity={2.2}\n          autoResumeDelay={1000}\n          resolution={isMobile ? 0.35 : 0.5}\n        />\n      </div>\n      \n      <div className=\"relative z-10\">\n        <section className=\"relative min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n          <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center z-10 px-4\">\n            <MetallicLogo \n              logoPath=\"/images/logo_tab.png\"\n              className=\"w-32 h-32 md:w-48 md:h-48 mb-6\"\n            />\n            \n            <TextType \n              text=\"NETCY\"\n              className=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-8\"\n              typingSpeed={500}\n              cursorCharacter=\"_\"\n            />\n            \n            <div className=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-8 max-w-2xl\">\n              <GradientText>Création de Sites Internet Sécurisé</GradientText>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p className=\"text-gray-200 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-xl mb-12 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n              Un projet web ? Discutons-en.\n            </p>\n            \n            <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n              <Link \n                href=\"/#contact\" \n                className=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6F3FFF] to-[#7A8FFF] hover:from-[#7A4FFF] hover:to-[#8A9FFF] rounded-lg font-semibold transition shadow-lg shadow-violet-500/30\"\n                style={{ width: '85px', height: '35px', padding: '10px 15px', boxSizing: 'content-box', fontSize: '17px' }}\n              >\n                Contact\n              </Link>\n              <Link href=\"/\">\n                <StarBorder\n                  as=\"span\"\n                  color=\"white\"\n                  speed=\"3s\"\n                  thickness={3}\n                >\n                  Voir le site\n                </StarBorder>\n              </Link>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n","usedDeprecatedRules":[]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jung Jean-Marie\\netcy_test\\src\\app\\sitemap.ts","messages":[],"suppressedMessages":[],"errorCount":0,"fatalErrorCount":0,"warningCount":0,"fixableErrorCount":0,"fixableWarningCount":0,"usedDeprecatedRules":[]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jung Jean-Marie\\netcy_test\\src\\components\\AnimatedContent.jsx","messages":[],"suppressedMessages":[],"errorCount":0,"fatalErrorCount":0,"warningCount":0,"fixableErrorCount":0,"fixableWarningCount":0,"usedDeprecatedRules":[]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jung Jean-Marie\\netcy_test\\src\\components\\Aurora.jsx","messages":[],"suppressedMessages":[{"ruleId":"react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","severity":1,"message":"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'blend' and 'colorStops'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.","line":199,"column":6,"nodeType":"ArrayExpression","endLine":199,"endColumn":17,"suggestions":[{"desc":"Update the dependencies array to be: [amplitude, blend, colorStops]","fix":{"range":[5763,5774],"text":"[amplitude, blend, colorStops]"}}],"suppressions":[{"kind":"directive","justification":""}]}],"errorCount":0,"fatalErrorCount":0,"warningCount":0,"fixableErrorCount":0,"fixableWarningCount":0,"usedDeprecatedRules":[]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jung Jean-Marie\\netcy_test\\src\\components\\CardNav.jsx","messages":[{"ruleId":"@typescript-eslint/no-unused-expressions","severity":1,"message":"Expected an assignment or function call and instead saw an expression.","line":48,"column":9,"nodeType":"ExpressionStatement","messageId":"unusedExpression","endLine":48,"endColumn":32}],"suppressedMessages":[{"ruleId":"react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","severity":1,"message":"React Hook useLayoutEffect has a missing dependency: 'createTimeline'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","line":100,"column":6,"nodeType":"ArrayExpression","endLine":100,"endColumn":19,"suggestions":[{"desc":"Update the dependencies array to be: [createTimeline, ease, items]","fix":{"range":[2651,2664],"text":"[createTimeline, ease, items]"}}],"suppressions":[{"kind":"directive","justification":""}]},{"ruleId":"react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","severity":1,"message":"React Hook useLayoutEffect has a missing dependency: 'createTimeline'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","line":141,"column":6,"nodeType":"ArrayExpression","endLine":141,"endColumn":18,"suggestions":[{"desc":"Update the dependencies array to be: [createTimeline, isExpanded]","fix":{"range":[3662,3674],"text":"[createTimeline, isExpanded]"}}],"suppressions":[{"kind":"directive","justification":""}]}],"errorCount":0,"fatalErrorCount":0,"warningCount":1,"fixableErrorCount":0,"fixableWarningCount":0,"source":"\"use client\";\n\nimport { useLayoutEffect, useRef, useState, useEffect } from 'react';\nimport { gsap } from 'gsap';\nimport Image from 'next/image';\nimport { GoArrowUpRight } from 'react-icons/go';\nimport './CardNav.css';\n\nconst CardNav = ({\n  logo,\n  logoAlt = 'Logo',\n  items,\n  className = '',\n  ease = 'power3.out',\n  baseColor = '#fff',\n  menuColor,\n  buttonBgColor,\n  buttonTextColor\n}) => {\n  const [isHamburgerOpen, setIsHamburgerOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isExpanded, setIsExpanded] = useState(false);\n  const [isHovered, setIsHovered] = useState(false);\n  const navRef = useRef(null);\n  const cardsRef = useRef([]);\n  const tlRef = useRef(null);\n\n  const COLLAPSED_WIDTH = 400;\n  const EXPANDED_WIDTH = 800;\n\n  const calculateHeight = () => {\n    const navEl = navRef.current;\n    if (!navEl) return 230;\n\n    const isMobile = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 768px)').matches;\n    if (isMobile) {\n      const contentEl = navEl.querySelector('.card-nav-content');\n      if (contentEl) {\n        const wasVisible = contentEl.style.visibility;\n        const wasPointerEvent